   "rule": "Pine Wave True Canon layer 4 passive art: each heal from your arts lays one Wood stack on the foe per 1 % of your health restored and gives you one Water stack.",
   "source": "world-depth:tung_dao",
   "approx": "Fires on any heal_restored (at most once a pulse) because art heals (a.heal) emit before s.cur_ev is populated; Wood stacks scale uncapped by floor(event.share / 0.01) while Water buff is always 1 stack per heal.",
   "records": [
    {
     "id": "eff:Answering Wave",
     "on": "heal_restored",
     "limit": {
      "per_pulse": 1
     },
     "scale": {
      "read": "event.share",
      "per": 0.01
